flowchart TD
NSGA2_Alg["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Attributes: pop_size n_gen sampling crossover mutation<br/>Methods: run_optimization select evolve"]
BufferCapacityProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes: n_var 6 xl {1-10} xu {1-10} n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Methods: _evaluate create_tasks"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>Buffer capacities for six delay buffers<br/>Domain {1-10} each"]
EvalPool["**Evaluation Pool**<br/>Attributes: processes tasks_queue<br/>Methods: map evaluate_worker"]
EvalWorker["**Evaluate Individual**<br/>Inputs: caps array length 6 base_seed n_replications<br/>Methods: evaluate_single_individual run replications aggregate metrics<br/>Outputs: per individual objectives wip and throughput"]
SimRunner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>Methods: run_simulation_with_caps run_simulation<br/>Parameters: warmup measure_until base_seed"]
SimModel["**Simulation Model**<br/>Constructs DelayBuffer and Machine instances using caps<br/>Methods: sample_wip collect_metrics<br/>Outputs: produced_parts throughput wip machine_energy"]
DelayBuffer_Class["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes: cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>Methods: put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
Machine_Class["**Machine**<br/>Attributes: name process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power active_count is_up<br/>Methods: run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
ObjectiveEvaluator["**Objective Aggregator**<br/>Methods: average across replications compute f1 f2<br/>Outputs: objective vector for optimizer"]
Exporter["**Result Exporter**<br/>Methods: export_history_to_csv<br/>Outputs: CSV file results"]

NSGA2_Alg --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> DecisionVars
BufferCapacityProblem --> EvalPool
EvalPool --> EvalWorker
EvalWorker --> SimRunner
SimRunner --> SimModel
SimModel --> DelayBuffer_Class
SimModel --> Machine_Class
SimModel --> EvalWorker
EvalWorker --> ObjectiveEvaluator
ObjectiveEvaluator --> BufferCapacityProblem
NSGA2_Alg --> Exporter